{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">有「神級美魔女」之稱的吳婉芳，不僅保養得宜，其育有的兩子一女更是完美遺傳了母親的高顏值與優良基因。日前，大仔胡智略、二仔胡智同及孻女胡智晴三兄妹激罕合體，齊齊飛到韓國旅行，畫面極度養眼。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"lynuswoo_1787481420_3969997127412416920_1463515047.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026bS3lKwcjUe1787811974.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"lynuswoo_1787481420_3969997127412416920_1463515047.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">二仔胡智同日前在社交平台開心分享了三兄妹的旅行合照，更幽默地打趣寫道：「三兄妹的旅行終於從群組聊天成真了！」相片中所見，三人顏值極高，玩得相當盡興。兩位哥哥更毫不吝嗇地展示身上的兄弟紋身，盡顯型格之餘，亦可見三兄妹感情極度深厚。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"lynuswoo_1787481420_3969997175655316181_1463515047.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/20263oWXZyx6fR1787811973.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"lynuswoo_1787481420_3969997175655316181_1463515047.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">除了擁有出眾外貌，吳婉芳的三名子女更是名副其實的「學霸」兼人生勝利組。大仔智略與二仔智同皆畢業於香港華仁書院及英國貴族學校哈羅公學。智略以一級榮譽畢業於倫敦大學經濟系，其後再深造修讀碩士；而智同則升讀頂尖學府牛津大學藝術系。智同不但讀書成績優異，更曾於英國健美比賽勇奪冠軍，現時已回港創業成為專業健身教練；至於細女智晴亦同樣曾在英國留學，三兄妹的學歷背景絕對無可挑剔。</span></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"2Nur6Xleey0ad8C251mueSP25RuyR-xL4W2UkeFtlJE.jpeg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026iJVl7mxlVN1787811974.jpeg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"2Nur6Xleey0ad8C251mueSP25RuyR-xL4W2UkeFtlJE.jpeg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"lynuswoo_1787481420_3969997194311541590_1463515047.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026kcNcRWubY71787811974.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"lynuswoo_1787481420_3969997194311541590_1463515047.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-27T07:40:07.462672+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":393,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}